{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/284871-interting-concepts-for-demon-charaters","id":284871,"title":"Interting Concepts for demon charaters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-17T05:55:22-07:00","id":284871,"title":"Interting Concepts for demon charaters","content":"I thought it would be cool for people to throw down some ideas of interesting concepts for demons. This is not so much for back story but for interesting mix of powers for a character.<br /> <br /> The way I would do it is what would you have as a starting character and what would you add on after for example<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Witness</span></b><br /> <br /> He is an informer. He is somehow always in the right place (or someone would say wrong place) at the right time. Just as long as someone get punished for the crime.<br /> <br /> <b>Embeds</b><br /> Shift Consequence<br /> Homogenous Memory<br /> Without A Trace<br /> Alibi<br /> <br /> <b>After Charater creation<br /> Embeds</b><br /> Identity Theft<br /> Never Here<br /> Everybody Knows<br /> <br /> <b>Exploits</b><br /> Possession<br /> Open-And-Shut Case<br /> Stalking Horse<br /> <br /> All you need to start with is Shift Consequence and Homogenous Memory. With this you can shoot someone in the face drop the gun in front of a cop and shift the consequences to your mook. Of course you would have given yourself an Alibi before hand. Who wouldn't? With Homogenous Memory everyone still remembers that a guy shot but now the person who had the gun and did the deed was your mook.<br /> Rob a bank and it goes bad? Shift the blame and the memories to your fall guy (everyone needs a fall guy, right?).<br /> <br /> Now there is no point framing people if people can CSI your ass so you need to make sure you go Without A Trace. Once you get good at ruining people\u2019s lives you can then steal their faces with Identity Theft or their bodies with Possession. You can also set up their fall with Stalking Horse and Everybody Knows so people think they are guilty even before you decide to be a bull in a china shop which is their lives.<br /> <br /> Now with Open-And-Shut-Case, you can do someone good stuffs. Demon is nothing without a cover right? Follow the same method but then use Open-And-Shut-Case to frame another guy first. Promise of freedom for a sign on the dotted line will do wonders. Just make sure you get them the sign before the power runs out. Then the guy or girl you really wanted to be framed will go down right after. A demon must be efficient.<br /> <br /> WIth this you can play the demon counter part of the Angel from the book with the magic type-writer that frames people. Just you have to do the dirty work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}